  vendor/norns        norns by monome: GPL-3.0.
  vendor/ndi-mod      ndi-mod by Michael Dewberry (Dewb): MIT.

The released firmware image is built from Patternflow's core and the libraries
it vendors, each under its own license; see vendor/patternflow/LICENSE and the
VENDORED.md files under vendor/patternflow/firmware/patternflow/src/.
